  "details": "Can't hear anybody or talk after restarting HMD, ie changing a battery on vive wireless.\nI assume disconnecting a wired HMD and connecting it back in will cause the same bug.\nSeems like vrchat loses every audio device (see screenshot). Mic device sets to \"None\" with no option to chose any other mic I have. All other applications work fine, mic and audio work fine everywhere except vrchat.\nThe only way to temporally fix the bug is to restart vrchat.",
